{"id":21,"name":"spearow","speciesId":21,"dex":21,"form":"normal","generation":1,"types":["normal","flying"],"stats":{"hp":40,"attack":60,"defense":30,"special-attack":31,"special-defense":31,"speed":70},"abilities":[{"name":"keen-eye","hidden":false},{"name":"sniper","hidden":true}],"height":3,"weight":20,"baseExp":52,"sprites":{"normal":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/21.png","shiny":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/other/official-artwork/shiny/21.png","icon":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/21.png"},"cry":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/cries/main/cries/pokemon/latest/21.ogg","genus":"Tiny Bird Pokémon","flavor":[{"version":"platinum","text":"It flaps its small wings busily to fly. Using its beak, it searches in grass for prey."},{"version":"red","text":"Eats bugs in grassy areas. It has to flap its short wings at high speed to stay airborne."},{"version":"yellow","text":"Inept at flying high. However, it can fly around very fast to protect its ter­ ritory."},{"version":"gold","text":"It flaps its short wings to flush out insects from tall grass. It then plucks them with its stubby beak."},{"version":"silver","text":"Very protective of its territory, it flaps its short wings busily to dart around at high speed."},{"version":"crystal","text":"To protect its territory, it flies around ceaselessly, making high- pitched cries."},{"version":"ruby","text":"SPEAROW has a very loud cry that can be heard over half a mile away. If its high, keening cry is heard echoing all around, it is a sign that they are warning each other of danger."},{"version":"emerald","text":"Its loud cry can be heard over half a mile away. If its high, keening cry is heard echoing all around, it is a sign that they are warning each other of danger."},{"version":"firered","text":"It busily flits around here and there. Even if it is frail, it c